 M002 provides a lintegral equality, not the monotonicity/constant integration and content comparison claimed in the prose. The candidate labels the content-limit assertion definition-level, but no precise definition or complete derivation was supplied.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Read all five task inputs and required Yui rules. The upper-cover route and D=0 projection route appear viable. Probed M001 hausdorffMeasure_of_lt_dimH, M002 MeasureTheory.lintegral_tsum, M003 LipschitzWith.dimH_image_le, and M004 Real.dimH_of_nonempty_interior in the pinned checkout. M003/M004 support the D=0 route. No successful structural artifact was submitted.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additio